  pages:
  - title: Level 4 - Glass tiles
    body: Glass is here! Take raw glass from the <b>Glass</b> pile and process it
      at the <b>Wood Cutter</b>, just like wood.
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Handle with care
    body: 'Finished glass tiles are fragile. Standing on them puts pressure on the
      glass and slowly cracks it.


      Don''t linger on glass floors - cracked
      tiles break and have to be built again.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
